{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641540/extras/demo-room.gif?t=1753760192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this cozy room decoration demo you play as Dalia, a young witch returning home after university. As you return, you will decorate Dalia's room and talk with Cosmo, your cat familiar.<br>  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641540/extras/header_customize.png?t=1753760192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641540/extras/stuff.gif?t=1753760192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in relaxing gameplay with no timers as you decorate areas at your own pace. With a touch of magic you can adjust the colors and sizes of objects to create the coziest spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641540/extras/header_coven.png?t=1753760192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641540/extras/cosmo.gif?t=1753760192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you return home, you will talk with Cosmo, your cat familiar, and give him some pats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641540/extras/header_features_2.png?t=1753760192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2e Story mode - Help Dalia unpack and decorate her room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Decorating Freedom - Complete tasks and customize Dalia's room to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf38 Cute and Cozy Art-style - Experience a soothing atmosphere with customizable weather and sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf8 Calm meditative gameplay - Relax as you play at your own pace with no timers.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3641540?t=1753760192","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3641540?t=1753760192","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641540/9bbcd4842e4905091a02bb627fb74bcdd850d434/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753760192","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641540/9bbcd4842e4905091a02bb627fb74bcdd850d434/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753760192","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641540/extras/demo-room.gif?t=1753760192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this cozy room decoration demo you play as Dalia, a young witch returning home after university. As you return, you will decorate Dalia's room and talk with Cosmo, your cat familiar.<br>  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641540/extras/header_customize.png?t=1753760192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641540/extras/stuff.gif?t=1753760192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in relaxing gameplay with no timers as you decorate areas at your own pace. With a touch of magic you can adjust the colors and sizes of objects to create the coziest spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641540/extras/header_coven.png?t=1753760192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641540/extras/cosmo.gif?t=1753760192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you return home, you will talk with Cosmo, your cat familiar, and give him some pats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641540/extras/header_features_2.png?t=1753760192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2e Story mode - Help Dalia unpack and decorate her room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Decorating Freedom - Complete tasks and customize Dalia's room to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf38 Cute and Cozy Art-style - Experience a soothing atmosphere with customizable weather and sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf8 Calm meditative gameplay - Relax as you play at your own pace with no timers.</p>","developers":["Tiny Kiwi Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2390130","name":"Design and Conjure"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641540/ba009bdf796769c65659677aa0b71cdfee8cc3fe/header.jpg?t=1753760192","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257158638,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158638/movie480.mp4?t=1753225655","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158638/movie_max.mp4?t=1753225655"},"name":"Design and Conjure Demo Trailer","thumbnail